OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after taxi driven wrong way
OL,4,Aon dual carriageway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a taxi
OL,7,Fknocked a cyclist off their bike and
OL,8,Fthen drove the wrong way down a dual
OL,9,Fcarriageway.
OL,11,FOfficers intervened on the A55
OL,12,Fwestbound on Anglesey on Monday
OL,13,Fevening, temporarily closing the road
OL,14,Fwhile they stopped the taxi between
OL,15,FRhosneigr and Rhostrehewfa.
OL,17,FNorth Wales Police said it had received
OL,18,Fa report of a taxi being stolen from
OL,19,FHolyhead at about 19:30 BST.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
