OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after taxi driven wrong way
OL,4,Aon dual carriageway
OL,5,
OL,6,FShortly after, the taxi had been
OL,7,Finvolved in a collision with a cyclist
OL,8,Fon London Road, during which several
OL,9,Fparked vehicles were also damaged,
OL,10,Fbefore entering the A55.
